{"branch":"인창점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">인창점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-ccc7107f5718888d.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"인창점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-ccc7107f5718888d.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>경기 구리시 건원대로 36 화성골드프라자 제407호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">경의중앙선</span><span>구리역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 8호선</span><span>구리역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 8호선</span><span>동구릉역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>구리고용복지플러스센터</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>구리고용복지플러스센터.인창중앙공원</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>인창119안전센터.광역면접교섭센터</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>인창119안전센터.광역면접교섭센터</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>인창지구대앞</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>인창지구대앞</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>인창삼보아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">8</span><span>구리역7번출구.환승센터1번승강장</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">9</span><span>구리역7번출구.환승센터.인창어반포레</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">10</span><span>구리우체국</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">11</span><span>삼환.신일아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">12</span><span>인창삼보아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">13</span><span>구리역.롯데백화점</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-numbe